# 03 — How I Diagnosed the Business

I did not start with:

> **“Which channel should we use?”**

I started with:

> **“What is actually constraining growth?”**

My working sequence:

```text
Business Objective
        ↓
Market + Competitors
        ↓
Customer / Buyer
        ↓
Positioning
        ↓
Data + Research
        ↓
Acquisition Funnel
        ↓
Bottleneck
        ↓
Hypothesis
        ↓
Prioritised Intervention
        ↓
Execution
        ↓
Measurement
        ↓
Learning
        ↓
Iteration
```

This allowed a search problem to be investigated as a **business problem**, rather than automatically prescribing SEO.

